---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import Downloads from '../components/Downloads.astro';
---
<Page title="Download Diffy — beta & alpha releases" description="Choose Diffy for macOS (beta), Windows (alpha), or Linux (alpha). A native Git diff viewer built in Rust.">
  <main id="main" class="download-page frame">
    <img class="character" src="/chameleon.webp" width="112" height="112" alt="Diffy’s chameleon" />
    <h1>A little less hunting.<br />A lot more reading.</h1>
    <p class="intro">Choose your platform. Every version requires Git.</p>
    <Downloads />
    <p class="download-note">Windows and Linux are early alphas with limited hardware testing.<br />Save this page for future releases. <a href="https://github.com/hitSlop/diffy/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Report a problem ↗</a></p>
  </main>
</Page>
